# Committed derived artifacts: small, deterministic, referenced by the README
# Quick Start and the benchmark split loader. The large feature matrices
# (features_output/{train,val,test}.parquet, descriptors.parquet) stay ignored
# as regenerable build artifacts — never force-add them to the repo.
!quality_output/quality.parquet
!benchmark_output/splits/*.parquet

